To run this code, navigate to CODE/NFLD_boots.ipynb and download the file. From DATA, you will need the following: Data_HOLY4.csv, Ages_HOLY4.txt, and HOLY4_Age_Distributions.csv. There will be some files exported over the course of the script. Do not comment these out, as they will be called back later. No special packages are needed in your environment, only numpy, matplotlib, and pandas. 
